@startuml sequence-signing
title Signing Operation — CryptoProvider Routing (SOAP → Card)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Primärsystem\n(Client System)" as PS
participant "konnektor-server\n(CXF SOAP)" as SOAP
participant "signature-lib\n(CryptoProvider)" as CP
participant "KeySourceAdapter\n(SICCT / PKCS11 / P12 / PC/SC)" as KSA
participant "sicct-server\n(Netty TCP)" as SICCT
participant "SICCT Terminal\n+ SMC-B Card" as KT

PS -> SOAP : SignDocument (SOAP, MTOM)\nAufrufKontext: {mandantId, clientSystemId, workplaceId}
SOAP -> SOAP : Validate AufrufKontext\n(FR-150: mandantId/clientSystemId/workplaceId mandatory)
SOAP -> SOAP : TUC_KON_000 access check\n(tenant authorization, error 4021 / 4204 on failure)
SOAP -> CP : sign(alias="sicct/praxis-a-slot0",\nalgorithm=ECDSA, data=DTBS)
CP -> CP : Resolve alias → SicctKeySourceAdapter\n(prefix "sicct/", FR-011)
CP -> CP : Emit audit log entry\n(alias, operation, caller, timestamp — FR-016)
CP -> KSA : sign(cardSlot, algorithm, data)
KSA -> SICCT : Acquire card lock (exclusive, FR-154)
SICCT -> KT : SICCT PERFORM SECURITY OPERATION\n(PSO: COMPUTE DS)\nover active TLS session
KT -> KT : Card executes ECDSA\nPrivate key never leaves chip (FR-094)
KT -> SICCT : Response APDU (signature bytes + SW 9000)
SICCT -> KSA : signature bytes
KSA -> CP : signature
CP -> CP : Update availability status: AVAILABLE
CP -> SOAP : signature
SOAP -> SOAP : Build SignDocument response\n(gematik SOAP with Status=OK, FR-153)
SOAP -> PS : SignDocumentResponse (SOAP, MTOM)

== Error path: TLS loss during operation ==

SICCT -> SICCT : TLS loss detected within 30 s (FR-136)
SICCT -> SICCT : Discard session keys\nTerminal → DISCONNECTED
SICCT -> KSA : SicctConnectionException
KSA -> CP : operation FAILED
CP -> CP : Emit audit log (FAILURE)
CP -> SOAP : KeySourceException (alias UNAVAILABLE)
SOAP -> PS : SOAP-Fault (Trace: error 4001, FR-153)

@enduml
